    "copy_ready_caveat": "PC-37 shows that one hard_to_enumerate_missingness_verified publication can coexist with complete assurance, hard-to-enumerate subgroup omission, nonresponse-mechanism failure, inaccessible-source missingness, proxy-validation failure, external-frame truncation, unvalidated imputation, or stale lineage. It creates no real-world finding."
  },
